01:35:14,542 --> 01:35:17,636
write a better write prompt ," and then we're going to feed them back into our agent.

1006
01:35:22,222 --> 01:35:23,780
And now we're going to run an experiment.

1007
01:35:24,272 --> 01:35:24,592
So

1008
01:35:25,934 --> 01:35:30,564
over in the UI we have data sets and experiments, we have my demo financial fails.

