01:35:33,870 --> 01:35:34,432
we can,

1010
01:35:37,294 --> 01:35:38,404
assuming I can scroll,

1011
01:35:39,790 --> 01:35:49,952
wire up an improved agent using those new improved prompts. So you can see the improved research prompt and the improved write prompt. This is otherwise exactly the same agent that it was before.

1012
01:35:50,832 --> 01:35:54,628
and you can create an evaluator with an experiment.

1013
01:35:57,806 --> 01:36:01,632
so what we're doing here is we're giving it a task.

1014
01:36:01,838 --> 01:36:03,232
A task can be anything.

