1016
01:36:07,054 --> 01:36:16,772
So if we were running an evaluator that was about tool calls, then your task could be just call this tool and see what the output of the tool is, and then you would evaluate that.

1017
01:36:17,072 --> 01:36:21,712
In this case, my task is run the entire agent again from start to finish.

1018
01:36:21,934 --> 01:36:22,980
