01:48:39,054 --> 01:48:40,836
So, just to recap,

1158
01:48:41,518 --> 01:48:44,960
we instrumented an agent with two lines of code, we traced it and we read our data.

1159
01:48:45,120 --> 01:48:55,280
We wrote a code eval and built-in LLM evals, we wrote a custom rubric from scratch, we validated our judge against human labels, we saved failures of the data set, we had Claude

